<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Disco's Spear God Aim or D.S.G.A for short is specifically for the Spear .308  and it is to be ran at 800 DPI with a horizontal sens of 15 and a vertical sens of 11 with a resolution of 1920x1080p on a stretched resolution of 4:3 set the button to active while holding, and set the key to anything that doesnt interfere with any other bind. That is it! Will be updating if needed in the future!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>2</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>MoveR 0 21
Delay 3 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 6 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 9 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Tom Clancy's Rainbow Six Siege</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>